   157	   - **The sample:** the random guardrail sample only, 35 questions per system-draw by seed 20261117, or all of them when a library holds
   158	     fewer. Covering cards are not in these shares. The three draws are pooled per system.
   159	   - **The shares:**
   160	     - the share of **decided** figure-question answers (supported or unsupported) that are unsupported;
   161	     - the same for yes/no questions;
   162	     - the share of decided worth marks that are trivia or duplicate.
   163	   - **Reported beside, not in the shares:** insufficient and no answer, with the number of splits and how each counting resolved them.
   164	   - **The bar:** the new system's share may not be more than 10 points above the old system's.
   165	   - **Exercised:** each subgroup needs at least 10 cards per system decided without a split (item 7), or it is "not exercised".
   166	9. **The controls,** outside every product count:
   167	   - 6 planted wrong answers (a rung moved, 3 per system). Each needs an explicit unsupported or insufficient mark, or the reading is invalid.
